"designator":"~D11","header":"IOH","id":"D11","net":"D11","type":"digital_io"},{"class":"digital","designator":"D12","header":"IOH","id":"D12","net":"D12","type":"digital_io"},{"class":"digital","designator":"D13","header":"IOH","id":"D13","net":"D13","type":"digital_io"},{"class":"ground","designator":"GND","header":"IOH","id":"GND","net":"GND","type":"ground"},{"class":"analog","designator":"AREF","header":"IOH","id":"AREF","net":"AREF","type":"analog_in"},{"class":"digital","designator":"SDA","header":"IOH","id":"SDA","net":"SDA","type":"digital_io"},{"class":"digital","designator":"SCL","header":"IOH","id":"SCL","net":"SCL","type":"digital_io"},{"class":"nc","designator":"NC","header":"POWER","id":"NC","net":"NC","type":"nc"},{"class":"power","designator":"IOREF","header":"POWER","id":"IOREF","net":"IOREF","type":"power_io"},{"class":"digital","designator":"RESET","header":"POWER","id":"RESET","net":"RESET","type":"digital_io"},{"class":"power","designator":"3V3","header":"POWER","id":"P3V3","net":"3V3","type":"power_io"},{"class":"power","designator":"5V","header":"POWER","id":"P5V","net":"5V","type":"power_io"},{"class":"ground","designator":"GND","header":"POWER","id":"POWER_6","net":"GND","type":"ground"},{"class":"ground","designator":"GND","header":"POWER","id":"POWER_7","net":"GND","type":"ground"},{"class":"power","designator":"VIN","header":"POWER","id":"VIN","net":"VIN","type":"power_io"},{"class":"digital","designator":"A0","header":"AD","id":"A0","net":"A0","type":"digital_io"},{"class":"digital","designator":"A1","header":"AD","id":"A1","net":"A1","type":"digital_io"},{"class":"digital","designator":"A2","header":"AD","id":"A2","net":"A2","type":"digital_io"},{"class":"digital","designator":"A3","header":"AD","id":"A3","net":"A3","type":"digital_io"},{"class":"digital","designator":"A4","header":"AD","id":"A4","net":"A4","type":"digital_io"},{"class":"digital","designator":"A5","header":"AD","id":"A5","net":"A5","type":"digital_io"},{"class":"digital","designator":"MISO","header":"ICSP","id":"ICSP_1","net":"D12","type":"digital_io"},{"class":"power","designator":"5V","header":"ICSP","id":"ICSP_2","net":"5V","type":"power_io"},{"class":"digital","designator":"SCK","header":"ICSP","id":"ICSP_3","net":"D13","type":"digital_io"},{"class":"digital","designator":"MOSI","header":"ICSP","id":"ICSP_4","net":"D11","type":"digital_io"},{"class":"digital","designator":"RESET","header":"ICSP","id":"ICSP_5","net":"RESET","type":"digital_io"},{"class":"ground","designator":"GND","header":"ICSP","id":"ICSP_6","net":"GND","type":"ground"},{"class":"digital","designator":"MISO2","header":"ICSP1","id":"MISO2","net":"MISO2","type":"digital_io"},{"class":"power","designator":"5V","header":"ICSP1","id":"ICSP1_2","net":"5V","type":"power_io"},{"class":"digital","designator":"SCK2","header":"ICSP1","id":"SCK2","net":"SCK2","type":"digital_io"},{"class":"digital","designator":"MOSI2","header":"ICSP1","id":"MOSI2","net":"MOSI2","type":"digital_io"},{"class":"digital","designator":"RESET2","header":"ICSP1","id":"RESET2","net":"RESET2","type":"digital_io"},{"class":"ground","designator":"GND","header":"ICSP1","id":"ICSP1_6","net":"GND","type":"ground"}],"role":"board"},"origin":"builtin","ref":"core.uno-r3","version":"1.0.0"}],"libraries":[]},"ext":{"x-iynk-solution":"void setup() {\n  pinMode(9, OUTPUT);\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  for (int v = 0; v <= 255; v++) {    // up: 256 steps of 4 ms\n    analogWrite(9, v);\n    delay(4);\n  }\n  for (int v = 255; v >= 0; v--) {    // and back down\n    analogWrite(9, v);\n    delay(4);\n  }\n}\n"},"format":"iynk.project","guide":{"hints":[{"de":"analogWrite(9, v) stellt das Tastverhältnis ein: 0 ist aus, 255 ist voll an. Pin 9 schaltet mit etwa 490 Hz, zu schnell, um es zu sehen.","en":"analogWrite(9, v) sets the duty: 0 is off and 255 is fully on. Pin 9 switches at about 490 Hz, too fast to see.","es":"analogWrite(9, v) fija el ciclo de trabajo: 0 es apagado y 255 encendido del todo. El pin 9 conmuta a unos 490 Hz, demasiado rápido para verlo.","fr":"analogWrite(9, v) règle le rapport cyclique : 0 est éteint et 255 complètement allumé. La broche 9 commute à environ 490 Hz, trop vite pour l'œil.","hi":"analogWrite(9, v) ड्यूटी तय करता है: 0 बंद है और 255 पूरी तरह चालू। पिन 9 लगभग 490 Hz पर स्विच होता है, जो दिखने के लिए बहुत तेज़ है।","zh":"analogWrite(9, v) 设置占空比：0 是关，255 是全开。9 号引脚的开关频率约为 490 Hz，快得看不出来。"},{"de":"Zwei for-Schleifen: v von 0 bis 255 mit delay(4) nach jedem Schritt, dann von 255 zurück auf 0.","en":"Two for loops: v from 0 up to 255 with delay(4) after each step, then from 255 down to 0.","es":"Dos bucles for: v de 0 a 255 con delay(4) después de cada paso, y luego de 255 a 0.","fr":"Deux boucles for : v de 0 à 255 avec delay(4) après chaque pas, puis de 255 à 0.","hi":"दो for लूप: v को 0 से 255 तक, हर कदम के बाद delay(4), फिर 255 से 0 तक नीचे।","zh":"两个 for 循环：v 从 0 升到 255，每一步后 delay(4)，然后从 255 降到 0。"},{"de":"analogWrite() macht den Pin von selbst zum Ausgang, aber pinMode(9, OUTPUT) in setup() sagt, was du meinst.","en":"analogWrite() makes the pin an output by itself, but pinMode(9, OUTPUT) in setup() says what you mean.","es":"analogWrite() convierte el pin en salida por sí mismo, pero pinMode(9, OUTPUT) en setup() deja claro lo que quieres.","fr":"analogWrite() met la broche en sortie tout seul, mais pinMode(9, OUTPUT) dans setup() dit clairement ce que vous voulez.","hi":"analogWrite() पिन को अपने-आप आउटपुट बना देता है, लेकिन setup() में pinMode(9, OUTPUT) से आपका इरादा साफ़ दिखता है।","zh":"analogWrite() 会自己把引脚设为输出，但在 setup() 里写上 pinMode(9, OUTPUT) 能表明你的意图。"}],"kind":"challenge","lede":{"de":"Pin 13 hat keinen PWM-Timer, also lässt der Fade-Sketch ihn nur blinken. Leg die LED auf den Pin ~9 (die Schaltung auf dem Steckbrett hat sie schon dort) und lass sie wirklich auf- und abschwellen: Zähl das Tastverhältnis von 0 bis 255 hoch und zurück auf 0, ein Schritt alle 4 ms, sodass ein voller Atemzug etwa 2 s dauert.","en":"Pin 13 has no PWM timer, so the fade sketch only blinks it. Move the LED to the ~9 pin (the breadboard circuit already has it there) and fade it for real: count the duty up from 0 to 255 and back down to 0, one step every 4 ms, so one full breath takes about 2 s.","es":"El pin 13 no tiene temporizador PWM, así que el sketch del fundido solo lo hace parpadear. Pasa el LED al pin ~9 (el circuito de la protoboard ya lo tiene ahí) y haz un fundido de verdad: sube el ciclo de trabajo de 0 a 255 y vuelve a bajarlo a 0, un paso cada 4 ms, para que una respiración completa dure unos 2 s.","fr":"La broche 13 n'a pas de timer PWM : le sketch de fondu ne fait que la faire clignoter. Déplacez la LED sur la broche ~9 (le circuit de la platine d'essai l'y a déjà) et faites un vrai fondu : montez le rapport cyclique de 0 à 255 puis redescendez à 0, un pas toutes les 4 ms, pour qu'une respiration complète dure environ 2 s.","hi":"पिन 13 के पीछे कोई PWM टाइमर नहीं है, इसलिए फ़ेड वाला स्केच उसे बस ब्लिंक करता है। LED को ~9 पिन पर ले जाएँ (ब्रेडबोर्ड सर्किट में वह पहले से वहीं है) और उसे सचमुच फ़ेड करें: ड्यूटी को 0 से 255 तक ऊपर और फिर 0 तक नीचे गिनें, हर 4 ms पर एक कदम, ताकि एक पूरी साँस लगभग 2 s में हो।","zh":"13 号引脚没有 PWM 定时器，所以渐变程序只会让它闪烁。把 LED 移到 ~9 引脚（面包板电路里已经接在那里了），让它真正地渐变：占空比从 0 数到 255，再降回 0，每 4 ms 一步，所以一次完整的“呼吸”大约需要 2 s。"},"legacyFigure":{"circuit":"fade-pwm","page":"/figures/boards/uno-r3.html","sheets":["board","breadboard","schematic","power"]},"starter":{"source":"src_sketch","template":"// The fade from pin 13: move it to a ~ pin so it really fades\nvoid setup() {\n  pinMode(13, OUTPUT);\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  for (int v = 0; v < 256; v++) {\n    analogWrite(13, v);\n    delay(8);\n  }\n}\n"},"title":{"de":"Den Fade echt machen","en":"Make the fade real","es":"Haz que el fundido sea de verdad","fr":"Un vrai fondu","hi":"फ़ेड को असली बनाएँ","zh":"让渐变真正起作用"}},"history":{"baseChain":"5d14c05ec75e16e25380d4ed2e65ec1aa6de5b5b57f8b3490a4dd8d6c6670e9e","baseRevision":0,"checkpoints":[],"ops":[]},"id":"prj_robotics-uno-r3-build-fade-pwm","license":{"spdx":"LicenseRef-iynk-pending"},"meta":{"createdAt":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","description":"Pin 13 has no PWM timer, so the fade sketch only blinks it. Move the LED to the ~9 pin (the breadboard circuit already has it there) and fade it for real: count the duty up from 0 to 255 and back down to 0, one step every 4 ms, so one full breath takes about 2 s.","kind":"challenge","locale":"en","tags":["uno-r3-build","challenge","uno-r3"],"title":"Make the fade real","updatedAt":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z"},"nets":[{"class":"signal","connections":[{"c":"brd_main","p":"D9"},{"c":"cmp_r3","p":"P1"}],"id":"net_d9","name":"D9"},{"class":"ground","connections":[{"c":"brd_main","p":"GND"},{"c":"cmp_led1","p":"K"}],"id":"net_gnd","name":"GND"},{"class":"signal","connections":[{"c":"cmp_led1","p":"A"},{"c":"cmp_r3","p":"P2"}],"id":"net_led1a_r3p2"}],"parameters":[],"provenance":{"contributors":[],"createdBy":"usr_iynk","createdWith":{"app":"iynk","version":"0.1.0"},"origin":{"at":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","catalogue":{"child":"fade-pwm","id":"uno-r3-build","lab":"robotics"},"kind":"migration","tool":"iynk-catalogue-convert/0.1"},"thirdParty":[{"id":"tp1","kind":"text","review":"unchecked","source":{"title":"Third-party lesson sites named in D-017"},"what":"Task wording, checks and timings may follow a third-party exercise site (F-197 review pending)"}]},"revision":0,"schemaVersion":"1.1","simulation":{"duration_ms":2500,"faults":[],"runtimes":[{"board":"brd_main","engine":"iynk-interp","id":"rtm_main"}],"seed":625341585,"solver":{"engine":"iynk-mna"},"world":{"inputs":[],"script":[]}},"sources":[{"board":"brd_main","content":"// The fade from pin 13: move it to a ~ pin so it really fades\nvoid setup() {\n  pinMode(13, OUTPUT);\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  for (int v = 0; v < 256; v++) {\n    analogWrite(13, v);\n    delay(8);\n  }\n}\n","id":"src_sketch","language":"arduino-cpp","path":"sketch.ino","role":"firmware"}],"tests":[{"che